    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning three-bedroom townhouse with an attractive red brick façade and a private rear courtyard.\r\n\r\nThis superb home welcomes you with a bright entrance hall featuring laminate flooring, convenient understairs storage and a guest W.C. To the left of the hallway is a spacious living room complete with ornate coving, a feature fireplace and double doors leading into the kitchen and dining area. The stylish kitchen boasts tiled flooring, modern cabinetry and attractive splashback tiling. The dining area opens directly onto the sunny rear courtyard, creating the perfect space to relax, unwind or entertain guests.Upstairs, the generous family bathroom features tiled flooring, a walk-in shower, separate bath and practical under-sink storage. Completing the accommodation are three well-proportioned bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes and laminate flooring. This amazing property also benefits from ample parking.\r\n\r\nIdeally situated in the popular Ridgewood development, the property is just a short walk from local shops, a pharmacy with medical centre and a crèche. Swords Village, the Pavilions Shopping Centre and Forest Little Golf Club are all nearby, while regular bus services and easy access to the M50 make commuting to Dublin City Centre quick and convenient."
      },
